### What this track proposes

This track rewrites the project documents for the direction of 2026-11-14: `README.md`,
`AGENTS.md`, the six Measure core documents, the wrong instructions of the other
`measure/*.md` files, the contradictions of `INTEGRATION.md`, and the planned-marker
amendment of the retire track (spec W4, one commit per file group). Each document keeps
the current state apart from the planned direction, and each direction item of W3 carries
the marker `(planned: <track id>)`. The documents record the license facts and the dev
commands of today. The evidence file lists each unchanged `measure/*.md` file and each
old `INTEGRATION.md` section for the retire track.

### How the current system works, per this spec

The repository holds five apps, and each app has its own Convex schema, curriculum,
design system, and `wrangler.jsonc`. Auth is the custom JWT layer of `packages/core-auth`
(cookie `bm_session`, 12-hour TTL), and `packages/ai-tutoring` calls the OpenRouter API
through `fetch` with the dev default `openrouter/free`. Each math app holds its own graph
files under `curriculum/skill-graph/`, under the in-repo contract
`kst-srs.v2/SPECIFICATION.md`. The Workers `integrated-math-3` and `bus-math-v2` exist on
workers.dev with no traffic, and no deploy ran from this repository. The documents still
describe the old plan, and some instructions are wrong today:
`measure/tech-stack.md` and `measure/tech-specs.md` name "Vercel (primary)",
`INTEGRATION.md` names root scripts that do not exist, `measure/monorepo-ops.md` gives
`npx convex run seed.ts`, and `measure/current_directive.md` gives the directive of
2026-06-09.

